{
  "$comment": [
    "Population: only positive evidence fills an answer; an absence of records never answers 'no'. Codes are checked with npm run verify-codes (fhir/terminology-check.md). The mappings are reasonable but not clinically reviewed.",
    "Not mapped, for want of data in the collections: children, education and income, AUDIT-C (the record holds at most the total score), drug use, family history (no FamilyMemberHistory), operations (no Procedures), the dates of the last visits, sick leave and rehabilitation."
  ],
  "items": {
    "a0b3d169-3aab-4fb8-b343-598fb127bc5f": {
      "$comment": "Email address: the patient's own",
      "populate": {
        "expression": "%patient.telecom.where(system = 'email').value.first()"
      }
    },
    "679f79cb-c7c4-4a79-85de-37878aad3b93": {
      "$comment": "Marital status, from Patient.maritalStatus (HL7 v3 MaritalStatus). Not mapped: cohabiting and registered partnership, which have no code of their own there (T, domestic partner, could be either).",
      "populate": {
        "expression": "%patient.maritalStatus.coding.where(system = 'http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-MaritalStatus').code.first().select(iif($this = 'S', {{option:Naimaton}}) | iif($this = 'M', {{option:Avioliitossa}}) | iif($this = 'D', {{option:Eronnut}}) | iif($this = 'L', {{option:Asumuserossa}}) | iif($this = 'W', {{option:Leski}}))"
      }
    },
    "72595235-532b-431f-a813-f1a08ba0dbdb": {
      "$comment": "Supplements or vitamins: an active vitamin (A11), mineral (A12) or iron, B12 or folic acid (B03) medication",
      "populate": {
        "answer": "Kyllä",
        "when": {
          "in": "medications",
          "codes": {
            "urn:oid:1.2.246.537.6.32": [
              "A11",
              "A12",
              "B03"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "9e8f1c96-98af-4d0d-9d81-f3ce0e304da4": {
      "$comment": "Which supplements",
      "populate": {
        "list": {
          "in": "medications",
          "codes": {
            "urn:oid:1.2.246.537.6.32": [
              "A11",
              "A12",
              "B03"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5a0ef412-11be-4d71-87ee-3045e8155ab8": {
      "$comment": "Weight and height (a free-text question): the latest weight within a year and height within five years, as in the physiotherapy form, e.g. '91.4 kg, 182 cm'",
      "populate": {
        "variables": {
          "weights": {
            "in": "observations",
            "codes": {
              "http://loinc.org": [
                "29463-7"
              ],
              "urn:oid:1.2.246.537.6.96": [
                "29463-7",
                "3141-9",
                "3142-7"
              ]
            },
            "where": "value.ofType(Quantity).exists() and effective.ofType(dateTime).toString().substring(0, 10) >= (today() - 1 year).toString()"
          },
          "weight": "%weights.aggregate(iif($total.empty() or $this.effective.ofType(dateTime).toString() > $total.effective.ofType(dateTime).toString(), $this, $total))",
          "heights": {
            "in": "observations",
            "codes": {
              "http://loinc.org": [
                "8302-2"
              ],
              "urn:oid:1.2.246.537.6.96": [
                "8302-2",
                "3137-7",
                "3138-5"
              ]
            },
            "where": "value.ofType(Quantity).exists() and effective.ofType(dateTime).toString().substring(0, 10) >= (today() - 5 years).toString()"
          },
          "height": "%heights.aggregate(iif($total.empty() or $this.effective.ofType(dateTime).toString() > $total.effective.ofType(dateTime).toString(), $this, $total))"
        },
        "expression": "iif(%weight.exists() or %height.exists(), (%weight | %height).value.ofType(Quantity).select(value.toString() + ' ' + (unit | code).first()).join(', '))"
      }
    },
    "a5a5d696-4f4d-4cb0-8cc5-2013a0c09e46": {
      "$comment": "Tobacco and nicotine: 'uses' when the latest smoking status within a year (LOINC 72166-2) is a current smoker, or there is an active nicotine medication (N07BA, a nicotine product too) or nicotine dependence (F17); 'has quit' when that status is ex-smoker and there's nothing current. Not 'no' from a never-smoker status: it says nothing of snus or other nicotine products.",
      "populate": {
        "variables": {
          "smokingStatus": {
            "in": "observations",
            "codes": {
              "http://loinc.org": [
                "72166-2"
              ]
            },
            "where": "effective.ofType(dateTime).toString().substring(0, 10) >= (today() - 1 year).toString()"
          },
          "latestStatus": "%smokingStatus.aggregate(iif($total.empty() or $this.effective.ofType(dateTime).toString() > $total.effective.ofType(dateTime).toString(), $this, $total))",
          "smokes": "%latestStatus.where(value.coding.where(system = 'http://snomed.info/sct' and (code = '77176002' or code = '65568007' or code = '449868002' or code = '230059006')).exists())",
          "quit": "%latestStatus.where(value.coding.where(system = 'http://snomed.info/sct' and (code = '8517006')).exists())",
          "nicotine": [
            {
              "in": "medications",
              "codes": {
                "urn:oid:1.2.246.537.6.32": [
                  "N07BA"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "in": "conditions",
              "codes": {
                "urn:oid:1.2.246.537.6.1": [
                  "F17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expression": "iif(%smokes.exists() or %nicotine.exists(), {{option:Käytän yhtä tai useampaa nikotiinituotetta}}, iif(%quit.exists(), {{option:Olen lopettanut}}))"
      }
    },
    "d2665248-f82d-47bb-8d74-70871d207679": {
      "$comment": "Vaccinations valid, by the form's example: a vaccination against diphtheria and tetanus (J07AM51, the dTap J07AJ52, or a combined J07CA) within the 10 years a booster lasts",
      "populate": {
        "answer": "Kyllä",
        "when": {
          "in": "immunizations",
          "codes": {
            "urn:oid:1.2.246.537.6.32": [
              "J07AM51",
              "J07AJ52",
              "J07CA"
            ]
          },
          "where": "occurrence.ofType(dateTime).toString().substring(0, 10) >= (today() - 10 years).toString()"
        }
      }
    },
    "73d97f6f-b3d3-4ec2-bd8e-b0e793093ed1": {
      "$comment": "Illnesses or injuries diagnosed now or in the past: by diagnoses at any time that aren't refuted (ICD-10), and active allergies. Acute illnesses that pass are left out where they'd tick an option for nearly everyone (colds, ear and eye infections). Not mapped: injuries (any sprain would count), operations (no Procedures), 'other', and 'none of these' (never filled from an absence of records).",
      "populate": {
        "options": {
          "Tapaturmavamma tai tuki- ja liikuntaelinten sairaus": {
